  "html": "<table align=\"right\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left; background:rgb(240,240,240); border:1px solid black; width:25%;\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background:#9999FF; font-size:150%;\"> On The Rocks\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Skill-_On_The_Rocks.png\" title=\"Image:Skill-_On_The_Rocks.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Skill-_On_The_Rocks.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Skill-_On_The_Rocks.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Skill Type: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Self Buff\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Trainer: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Mage\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Number of Ranks: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Cost to Max: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">946937\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">Chill Bill gets Max Health increase. Melee attacks on Bill may reduce attacker Movement Speed and Attack Speed.\n</td></tr></table>\n<p>Activate this skill when <a class=\"missing\" href=\"/wiki/Chill_Bill\" title=\"Chill Bill\">Chill Bill</a> is nearby to freeze him into a solid block of ice.  The air surrounding the ice cube is so cold that enemeies within 7 meters of Bill have their Attack Speed and Movement Speed slowed.  Bill remains in this frozen state for 8 seconds.\n</p><p>The slow effect can be resisted with Ice Resistance.  Bill's aggro value is increase by 50% while in ice form.\n</p><p><b>Cool Down:</b> 25 seconds\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><b>While in his ice block, enemies within 7 meters of Bill have their Attack Speed slowed by X% and Movement Speed slowed by Y%.</b><br/>\n</p>\n<table align=\"left\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:center; width:100%; background:rgb(240,240,240);\">\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"10%\">Skill Level\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">1\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">2\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"5%\">Req Char Lvl\n</td><td> 35\n</td><td> 67\n</td><td> 99\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"5%\">X\n</td><td> 20\n</td><td> 25\n</td><td> 30\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"5%\">Y\n</td><td> 30\n</td><td> 40\n</td><td> 50\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"5%\">Mana\n</td><td> 226\n</td><td> 393\n</td><td> 560\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"5%\">Upgrade Cost\n</td><td> 164889\n</td><td> 315646\n</td><td> 466402\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
}
